:''For the enemies, see [[Wicked Axe Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Axe Cat]] and [[Malevolent Dark Cat]].''
'''Brainwashed Axe Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Easter Carnival (Gacha Event)|Easter Carnival]], [[Valentine Gals (Gacha Event)|Valentine Gals]], [[Gals of Summer Sunshine (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Sunshine]] and [[Excellent 4 Selection (Gacha Event)|Excellent 4 Selection]] events. It was added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]] increases health and grants a level 1 [[Wave Attack#Mini-Wave|Mini-Wave]].

{{Cat Info
